# The kiosk console (BASHOS_CONSOLE=auto|kiosk): a Wayland compositor whose only window is a
# terminal running the shared tmux session — truecolor and real fonts on the physical monitor,
# where the bare Linux console has 16 colours. Same line format as base.list.
cage
foot foot-terminfo
fonts-jetbrains-mono
# turning the monitor (BASHOS_CONSOLE_ROTATE) and serving it over VNC (BASHOS_CONSOLE_VNC)
wlr-randr
wayvnc
